OL,3,AMPs and Lords call for new law to
OL,4,Aaddress AI threat to human rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cross-party group of MPs and peers
OL,7,Fhas identified human rights risks posed
OL,8,Fby artificial intelligence (AI),
OL,9,Farguing existing laws are ill-equipped
OL,10,Fto address the technology's rapid
OL,11,Fgrowth.
OL,13,FThe Joint Committee on Human Rights
OL,14,F(JCHR) published a report calling for a
OL,15,Fnew bill on AI to "address the scale
OL,16,Fand seriousness" of such threats.
OL,18,F"Nowhere in the world, including the
OL,19,FUK, has a current legislative and
OL,20,Fregulatory approach to AI that is fit
OL,21,Ffor purpose," said Labour MP and
OL,22,Fcommittee chair Alex Sobel.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
