OL,3,AMPs and Lords call for new law to
OL,4,Aaddress AI threat to human rights
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour education minister Georgia Gould
OL,7,Fsaid AI was creating opportunities but
OL,8,Fthat is was critical the government was
OL,9,F"responding to those risks" posed by
OL,10,Fthe technology.
